  <project_license>AGPL-3.0-or-later</project_license>
  <name>Bluepencil</name>
  <summary>Read, organize and compress PDFs</summary>
  <description>
    <p>
      Bluepencil does in one window what usually takes several apps and an
      upload website. Everything happens on your computer: the app has no
      network access at all, so your documents never leave it.
    </p>
    <ul>
      <li>Read PDFs with zoom, page thumbnails and a list of recent files</li>
      <li>Rotate, delete, duplicate, move and insert pages, one or many at once</li>
      <li>Combine PDFs and pictures into one document, or split one into parts</li>
      <li>Compress a PDF into a smaller copy, with the real size shown first</li>
      <li>Undo every change: nothing is written until you save</li>
    </ul>
  </description>
